{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "20220428-信达证券-因子选股-001-基于分钟线的高频选股因子",
  "genre": "research",
  "asset": ["stock_cn"],
  "primary": "L1_factor",
  "pipe": {
    "L0_data": {
      "module": ["L0_derivation"],
      "approach": ["reconstruction"],
      "setup": {"data": {"source": ["market_l1_l2"], "freq": "l2"}}
    },
    "L1_factor": {
      "module": ["L1_market"],
      "approach": ["momentum_reversal", "distribution_moment", "intraday_pattern"],
      "setup": {
        "universe": ["all"],
        "data": {"source": ["market_minute"], "freq": "minute"},
        "holding": {"rebalance": "daily", "horizon": "daily"}
      },
      "factors": [
        {
          "name": "高频收益反转因子",
          "family": "reversal",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "intraday",
          "formula": "-\\frac{1}{30}\\sum_{t-29}^{t} r_{i,t}",
          "stats": [null, 0.09, 0.97, null],
          "evidence": "本文尝试使用当前 30分钟区间内的每分钟收益取均值去预测下一个 30分钟的收益序列，例如 09：30分至 10：00的信号预测 10：00至 10：30分的收益率，因构建逻辑是一个负向指标，因此在均值前添加负号"
        },
        {
          "name": "日频收益反转因子",
          "family": "reversal",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "daily",
          "formula": "-\\frac{1}{235}\\sum_{t=1}^{t=235} r_{i,t,T}",
          "stats": [null, 0.033, 0.26, null],
          "evidence": "从下表可以看出收益反转因子在日度上并不是很有效，总体日度 Rank IC只有 0.033，ICIR为0.26，且年度来看并不稳定。"
        },
        {
          "name": "改进放量的正收益反转因子",
          "family": "reversal",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "daily",
          "formula": "-\\frac{\\sum_{t=1}^{t=235} r_{i,t,T} I_{r_{i,t,T}>0} I_{vol_{i,t}>vol_{up,i,T}}}{\\sum_{t=1}^{t=235} I_{r_{i,t,T}>0} I_{vol_{i,t}>vol_{up,i,T}}}",
          "stats": [null, 0.0599, 0.74, null],
          "evidence": "只统计收益大于 0 且属于放量时段的收益均值，当全天没有放量且大于 0 的收益，则从当天的样本池中剔除该股票"
        },
        {
          "name": "改进放量的负收益动量因子",
          "family": "momentum",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "daily",
          "formula": "\\sum_{t=1}^{t=235} r_{i,t,T} I_{r_{i,t,T}<0} I_{vol_{i,t}>vol_{up,i,T}}",
          "stats": [null, 0.046, 0.62, null],
          "evidence": "正收益的强反转与负收益的弱动量也证明了上述多头与空头力量存在差异的结论。"
        },
        {
          "name": "高频收益波动率因子",
          "family": "volatility",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "intraday",
          "formula": "-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{30}\\sum_{t-29}^{t}(r_{i,t}-r_{i,mean})^2}",
          "stats": [null, 0.0334, 0.33, null],
          "evidence": "即使用当前 30 分钟区间内的分钟收益标准差去预测下一个 30分钟的收益序列，例如 09：30分至 10：00的信号预测 10：30 分的时点价相对 10：00 的时点价的收益。"
        },
        {
          "name": "日频收益波动率",
          "family": "volatility",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "daily",
          "formula": "-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{235}\\sum_{t=1}^{t=235}(r_{i,t,T}-r_{i,mean,T})^2}",
          "stats": [null, 0.0562, 0.45, null],
          "evidence": "在日度层面，为了保证因子的时效性，该因子预测目标为当日收盘价距下一个交易日收盘价的收益。"
        },
        {
          "name": "日频改进收益波动率因子",
          "family": "volatility",
          "direction": "positive",
          "data_period": ["intraday"],
          "horizon": "daily",
          "formula": "-\\sqrt{\\sum_{r_{i,t,T}\\in r_{vol_{up},T}} \\frac{(r_{i,t,T}-r_{mean,T})^2}{\\|r_{vol_{up},T}\\|}}",
          "stats": [null, 0.0652, 0.7, null],
          "evidence": "当第 t分钟成交量大于分钟成交量均值加分钟成交量标准差时，将第 t分钟定义为放量时段"
        },
